OL,3,GNEWSACall to use car park site for
OL,4,Asocial homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FOpposition councillors have called for
OL,7,Fa car park site set aside for new
OL,8,Fhousing to be used to build social
OL,9,Fhomes.
OL,11,FReigate and Banstead Borough Council
OL,12,F(RBBC) is pursuing the redevelopment of
OL,13,FHigh Street Car Park in Horley into
OL,14,Fabout 40 homes.
OL,16,FThe authority's overview and scrutiny
OL,17,Fcommittee asked the executive on
OL,18,FWednesday to reconsider a decision from
OL,19,FSeptember to sell the car park on the
OL,20,Fopen market.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
