OL,3,GNEWSACall to use car park site for
OL,4,Asocial homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FGreen group head Jonathan Essex said
OL,7,Fthe authority should not be "selling
OL,8,Foff assets to the private sector", but
OL,9,Fcouncil leader Richard Biggs said the
OL,10,Fdecision was "a sensible use of
OL,11,Fresources".
